    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《好天--ah（一）：昨暝hit tsūn雨》</span><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">/雁翎</span></h2><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgh0v3fguGxM1BPmkpJoD1HX6eTRJeShrnep4yjOPS77bvKw6Xj83O1wS7nhWKDRz3i0gNFnmY-1-GBnDxwqG-LS5JccTo4Yvys5S9tKuV4DL2KOXJPqkBSxBuO5MFks_LEHW8U--w_oo1ou8tGvPEanLL-SftK5LM2c-eygkEAW4S6JAqh2pXKe3KqiHcf\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgh0v3fguGxM1BPmkpJoD1HX6eTRJeShrnep4yjOPS77bvKw6Xj83O1wS7nhWKDRz3i0gNFnmY-1-GBnDxwqG-LS5JccTo4Yvys5S9tKuV4DL2KOXJPqkBSxBuO5MFks_LEHW8U--w_oo1ou8tGvPEanLL-SftK5LM2c-eygkEAW4S6JAqh2pXKe3KqiHcf\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEigtapdTaCE_zXUNu7FjAaZHBquWYb3X2vcspMzTIWXSN8WP7VJKUWK-sR76_2xdZxH-UvwjGHCxyJ2AQrndDYeAMlBrAC9gZVirSPwvVD04gByXnWbCPmeSszTNpBUvfbOb5JD6G7O_Mcjrh6-uqdlx0SJPwBJwHtiVZIKb1b0OBleQRwc9Ap8eM8o8zVl\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEigtapdTaCE_zXUNu7FjAaZHBquWYb3X2vcspMzTIWXSN8WP7VJKUWK-sR76_2xdZxH-UvwjGHCxyJ2AQrndDYeAMlBrAC9gZVirSPwvVD04gByXnWbCPmeSszTNpBUvfbOb5JD6G7O_Mcjrh6-uqdlx0SJPwBJwHtiVZIKb1b0OBleQRwc9Ap8eM8o8zVl=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjD9yq1NFpyN76EkKuaYJBg2cI0-5_SkTPT9y0rF-BlfCu9_ZLA6qylWyZHoWDKHKqNrIU3UFvpumzs8naO-FvdltDcaWJauF0gX06cFCGWHakPR591KDBEMP6XvXQjSD2GCW4efldygEM4CDOIxz-r3